<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25386" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διανθ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>adorn with flowers,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὴν κεφαλὴν στεφάνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
				</span></i>
			<i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); also with jewels, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				8.5.2
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be picked out, decorated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλαμύδες διηνθισμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Phil.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέδρου ζῴδια χρυσῷ διηνθισμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					6.19.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξόανον χρυσῷ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.26.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				5.3.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηκέτι διηνθισμένος ποικιλίᾳ
				χρωμάτων, ὅλον δὲ λευκωθείς,</span> of a leper, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.346
			</span></i>.</div>
